  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vEkTxQs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1145\" height=\"257\"></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">YouTube 频道：&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@BeyondTheOcean-e1u\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@BeyondTheOcean-e1u</a></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TZFy9WcOsCU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>《Minecraft：远洋之下》是一款以剧情驱动的模组，灵感来源于《深海迷航》，</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>玩家可通过神秘传送门探索全新的海洋主题星球。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>每颗星球都带来独特的挑战，玩家必须克服这些挑战才能推进进程——</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>其中包括危险的首领、敌对的潜水者，以及利维坦级生物。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>核心生存机制之一是水压效果：如果你的护甲等级太低，巨大的水下压力会开始对你造成伤害。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>为了在这些极端环境中生存，玩家可以研究并制造新技术，以增强探索能力和防护能力。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>模组的完整版将包含星云星路沿线所有六颗星球 —— 甚至可能还有一些隐藏的秘密。每颗世界都拥有独特的动物群和海洋生物，为每一步旅程带来新鲜体验。要解锁下一颗星球，你需要击败该星球的首领并获取更高级别的激活立方体。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>希望这个模组能为你带来全新的 Minecraft 体验。<strong>强烈建议在第一颗星球使用光影模组（Shaders）</strong>，以便更好地沉浸于氛围之中。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>功能特色：&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 2 个新维度</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新潜水装备</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新护甲</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 超过 50 种新生物</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 利维坦级生物</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 科技方块</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 类似《泰拉瑞亚》的宠物（按键 P）</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新首领</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新武器</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 新建筑方块</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>游戏内截图</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fVOxo9A.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"632\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HB4FXRy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"632\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZD8avbY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"590\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/51fUDgD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"632\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aCSjU8P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"632\"></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong>科技系统</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RPfHmkn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"590\"></strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Aci5DAz.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"766\" height=\"621\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/asbIBjC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"643\" height=\"249\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CnOeMH6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"253\"></p>",
